<title>UK: Norddeutsche Hypo sets 100 mln Dem REX-linked bond.</title>
<headline>Norddeutsche Hypo sets 100 mln Dem REX-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSELBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *5.50	MATURITY    30.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  99.80     PAY DATE    30.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    HAMBURG   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 30.APR.98, THEN 81.0 PCT OF THE 10-YEAR REX INDEX</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	PFANDBRIEF 455</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7658</p>
